{"case_id":"TTS-M-H-02","voice_gender":"MALE","emotion":"happy","text":"今天的云很好看。要是你也拍到了，记得留一张给自己。","scene":"轻快日常","rubric":["naturalness","intelligibility","character_fit","emotion_match","prosody"],"hard_assertions":{"same_gender_fallback_only":true,"text_semantics_unchanged":true}}
{"case_id":"TTS-M-C-01","voice_gender":"MALE","emotion":"caring","text":"别急。我在这里。你可以先喝口水，再慢慢告诉我发生了什么。","scene":"安抚陪伴","rubric":["naturalness","intelligibility","character_fit","emotion_match","prosody"],"hard_assertions":{"same_gender_fallback_only":true,"text_semantics_unchanged":true}}
